<title>USA: FSA qualifies four muni bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies four muni bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Lino Lakes, Minn., $8.005 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--St Louis County, Minn., school district No 2142, $3.045 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Washington Township, N.J., $7.145 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Watauga, Texas, $11.37 million revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
